        "Product Advantages",
        "1. Dual functions of self‑air‑suction and flotation.\n2. Adopts a novel impeller structure with backward‑inclined double‑sided blades, realizing double pulp circulation inside the cell.\n3. Production specification range: 1.2 m³‑50 m³.\n4. Effective volume range: 1.2 m³‑50 m³.",
