        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      [
        "Working Principle",
        "The motor drives the main shaft via V‑belt to rotate the impeller at its lower end. Air is sucked into the upper impeller chamber through the air suction pipe and central cylinder, mixes with the incoming pulp to form mineralized froth, so as to separate valuable minerals and obtain target minerals.",
